WEBVTT

00:00:15.154 --> 00:00:16.285
Hey!
嘿

00:00:16.329 --> 00:00:17.721
Hey, I did it!
哇 我做到了

00:01:27.269 --> 00:01:28.618
[RUMBLING]
[GASPS]

00:01:29.228 --> 00:01:30.229
Ah!

00:01:31.970 --> 00:01:33.275
[BLOWING]

00:01:35.625 --> 00:01:37.062
[GROWLING]

00:01:37.105 --> 00:01:38.498
[YELLS] Whoa!

00:01:39.455 --> 00:01:41.501
Back! Stay back!
别过来 退后

00:01:41.544 --> 00:01:43.372
Stay back!
走开

00:01:48.682 --> 00:01:49.944
[ROARING]

00:01:50.945 --> 00:01:51.990
[BLOWS]

00:01:53.992 --> 00:01:55.515
[CRASHES]

00:01:55.558 --> 00:01:56.820
[BOTH BLOWING]

00:02:01.651 --> 00:02:02.914
[PURRS]

00:02:11.357 --> 00:02:12.619
[GASPS]

00:02:13.185 --> 00:02:14.403
[GRUNTS]

00:02:17.232 --> 00:02:18.407
[CONTINUES PURRING]

00:02:22.150 --> 00:02:23.412
[RUMBLING]

00:02:25.588 --> 00:02:27.764
[LOW NOTE PLAYING ON SHELL]
[GASPS]
他们有麻烦了

00:02:27.808 --> 00:02:29.462
They're in trouble.
他们有麻烦了

00:02:29.505 --> 00:02:32.247
Hang on, I'm coming!
你们撑着 我来了

00:02:32.291 --> 00:02:34.119
How do I get across?
我要怎么过去

00:02:34.162 --> 00:02:37.470
I have to think.
What would Guy do?
我得想想 阿盖会怎么做

00:02:37.513 --> 00:02:40.168
What would Guy do,
what would Guy do?
阿盖会怎么做 阿盖会怎么做

00:02:42.431 --> 00:02:44.346
What would I do?
我会怎么做

00:02:45.173 --> 00:02:46.696
Hold this.
帮我拿一下

00:02:51.092 --> 00:02:52.267
[STRAINING]

00:02:55.357 --> 00:02:56.532
[GRUNTS]

00:03:02.060 --> 00:03:05.672
I have...
我有了...

00:03:05.715 --> 00:03:10.329
an idea!
一个点子

00:03:12.374 --> 00:03:13.375
[GRUNTS]

00:03:19.816 --> 00:03:21.122
[SHOUTING GIBBERISH]

00:03:25.953 --> 00:03:27.172
[YELPING]

00:03:30.914 --> 00:03:32.046
Run!
快跑

00:03:52.197 --> 00:03:53.415
[GRUG SCREAMS]

00:03:56.766 --> 00:03:57.941
[SCREAMING]

00:04:07.951 --> 00:04:08.952
[GRUNTS]

00:04:13.218 --> 00:04:14.610
Yes!
就是这样

00:04:22.096 --> 00:04:23.706
Douglas?
道格拉斯

00:04:23.750 --> 00:04:25.447
Hey, I know that guy.
等一下 我认识那家伙

00:04:27.971 --> 00:04:29.103
[RUMBLING]

00:04:32.063 --> 00:04:33.194
[PANTING]

00:04:34.326 --> 00:04:35.805
[ANIMAL WHINING]

00:04:40.984 --> 00:04:42.116
[BOTH CHITTERING]

00:04:52.387 --> 00:04:53.475
[GRUNTS]

00:04:56.609 --> 00:04:57.784
[ALL WHIMPERING]

00:05:00.656 --> 00:05:02.310
Hold on!
抓好

00:05:03.572 --> 00:05:04.834
[GRUNTING]

00:05:21.199 --> 00:05:22.852
[PLAYING LOW NOTE]

